// TF2Descent's startup script, seeded into cfg/ when absent, as the TF2 mod's.
// The engine runs valve.rc instead of the command line's + commands when one
// exists, so this must end in stuffcmds, or +map never runs. HL2MP's pack
// answered for it on the MOD path until the mod stopped mounting HL2MP.
exec autoexec.cfg
stuffcmds
